      <div class="box">
        <h2>Background & Motivation</h2>
        <p>The integration of AI into clinical decision-making represents a rapidly evolving frontier. A growing body of evidence examines how machine-learning-based clinical decision support systems (CDSS) perform across diagnostic, prognostic, and therapeutic domains. Despite promising results in controlled settings, the translation of AI tools into routine practice remains limited.</p>
